# A Computerized Communication Message Preparation Program that &quot;Learns&quot; the User's Vocabulary.

**Authors:** Scull, John, Hill, Linda

## Abstract
&quot;Cued Typing&quot; is a computerized communication message preparation program, written for Apple II Plus, using frequency-based prediction algorithms and menu selection to reduce word cost while maintaining vocabulary flexibility. &quot;Cued Typing&quot; was more efficient than letter-by-letter typing, but word cost was still quite high, and communication speed did not improve. (Author/JDD)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ374959

